    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: c81e5d59e1f3422fa810f2b195900dca
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'When it sees or hears an ally of its own fall nearby (within 5 s, 25 m), it swears to get the killer: that hostile becomes its target for 15 s over anyone else, it uses its boost (EnemyData › Kit › Boost) if it has one, and radios its kin. Killing one in front of the others has consequences. Interrupts whatever is below it.'
